  "summary_en": "Proposes a draft open standard (RFC-style) for an 'ethical black box', a secure recorder of sensor, actuator and decision data in social robots, to support accident and near-miss investigation, accountability and explainability. Annex A specifies normative data structures and record formats.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Social robots should be fitted with an ethical black box analogous to aircraft flight data recorders.",
   "EBB must be a passive, one-way recording subsystem that does not affect robot operation.",
   "Standardisation aids accident investigation, debugging, explainability and may encourage regulators to require EBBs.",
   "Annex A defines meta data, data data and robot data records with timestamps and checksums in a circular buffer.",
   "Draft follows BS 0:2021 and open-standard criteria, offered for community feedback."
  ],
